# Workflow Output Pipeline

Mọi skill **sinh output** phải tuân pipeline:

```
Generate → Cross-reference → Gap Check → Review → Hoàn tất
```

## Cross-reference (bắt buộc trước Gap Check)

Đối chiếu output với:

- [`docs/spec/_index.md`](../../docs/spec/_index.md) — master index 01–12
- RE Phase 9.5 publish: `output/cursor/` → `docs/spec/01`–`10`
- WF ↔ `docs/spec/03-business-rules.md`
- Entity list ↔ Prisma / FD (`docs/spec/02`)
- Route inventory ↔ `docs/spec/08-api-contracts.md`

## Skills (gọi bằng `/`)
| Skill | Output |
|-------|--------|
| `/reverse-engineering-java` | `output/cursor/`, `docs/spec/01-10` (Phase 9.5) |
| `/generate-workflow-docs` | `output/cursor/workflows/WF-*.md` |
